    <string name="settings_about_title">About</string>
    <string name="settings_about">Version %1$s\nPokémon data &amp; prices: TCGdex (tcgdex.dev)\nOne Piece data &amp; prices: OPTCG API (optcgapi.com)\nMagic data &amp; prices: Scryfall (scryfall.com)\nDragon Ball, Union Arena, Weiss Schwarz, Naruto: TCGplayer via TCGCSV (tcgcsv.com)\nExchange rates: Frankfurter (ECB)\nText recognition runs on-device with Google ML Kit.</string>

